# ThreadSanitizer suppressions for this repo's tests. Each entry needs a
# comment with the reason and a docs/upstream_issues.md entry. Never suppress
# reports with robotraconteur_ros2_debug_bridge frames.

# Robot Raconteur master 7cd1610c, client connect path (ConnectService):
# RobotRaconteurNode_connector::connected_transport holds the connector mutex
# and calls ClientContext::AsyncConnectService (ClientContext mutex), while
# ClientContext::AsyncConnectService7 holds the ClientContext mutex and its
# completion calls RobotRaconteurNode_connector::connected_client (connector
# mutex). Potential deadlock entirely inside Robot Raconteur's client code (the
# tests' client nodes); reported to the RR maintainer 2026-11-14.
deadlock:RobotRaconteur::detail::RobotRaconteurNode_connector

# Fast DDS 2.14 (rmw_fastrtps_cpp, Jazzy): its shared-memory transport thread
# (dds.shm.*) copies into a TopicPayloadPool payload buffer
# (TopicPayloadPool::get_payload, do_get_payload) while a reader thread
# deserializes from the
# same buffer (fastcdr Cdr::deserialize_array). Both racing stacks are entirely
# in Fast DDS/fastcdr, no robotraconteur_ros2_debug_bridge frames. Seen in
# test_topics__rmw_fastrtps_cpp on the GitHub TSan job (run 43682189102),
# 2026-11-15. Same user decision as ../rmw_intraprocess (upstream races
# suppressed narrowly); docs/upstream_issues.md.
race:eprosima::fastrtps::rtps::TopicPayloadPool::

# rclcpp MultiThreadedExecutor workers during an entity recollect (a component
# loaded by rclcpp_components::ComponentManager): one worker frees an object
# another used under a mutex in NodeBase::callback_group_in_node; the ordering
# is a shared_ptr refcount inside the uninstrumented librclcpp. Both stacks
# are entirely in librclcpp, no robotraconteur_ros2_debug_bridge frames. Seen
# in test_components on the GitHub TSan job (run 43683767686), 2026-11-15. The
# same entry is in ../rmw_intraprocess (test_composition_demo); same user
# decision; docs/upstream_issues.md.
race:rclcpp::node_interfaces::NodeBase::callback_group_in_node
